# Binary and line-delimited per-cell outputs exceed the 64 KB data-file policy and the artifact store refuses uploads from this runtime.
# They stay on the run host; data/SHA256SUMS records them and data_json/ holds lossless JSON mirrors (export_json.py, exact reload check).
data/**/*.npz
data/*.npz
data/**/*.jsonl
data/*.jsonl
__pycache__/
